{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"At night, the sky fills with tiny lights. These lights are called stars.","words":[[0,0.22],[0.36,0.79],[0.84,0.95],[1.01,1.41],[1.54,1.92],[1.97,2.16],[2.24,2.63],[2.71,3.27],[3.66,3.97],[4.05,4.4],[4.45,4.59],[4.63,4.95],[5.02,6.08]]},{"text":"Stars are not tiny. They are huge, glowing balls of hot gas far, far away.","words":[[0,0.55],[0.6,0.78],[0.85,1.06],[1.11,1.66],[1.9,2.1],[2.15,2.3],[2.38,2.83],[2.89,3.31],[3.39,3.76],[3.82,3.91],[4.02,4.26],[4.33,4.66],[4.79,5.25],[5.32,5.61],[5.68,6.41]]},{"text":"The star closest to us is the Sun. It looks big because it is much closer than other stars.","words":[[0,0.21],[0.27,0.64],[0.72,1.22],[1.26,1.33],[1.42,1.56],[1.64,1.76],[1.83,1.93],[2.01,2.53],[2.86,3.01],[3.06,3.32],[3.42,3.7],[3.79,4.14],[4.19,4.26],[4.32,4.43],[4.57,4.85],[4.93,5.36],[5.42,5.6],[5.69,5.97],[6.04,7.01]]},{"text":"Other stars are so far away that they look like tiny dots in the sky.","words":[[0,0.34],[0.41,0.85],[0.91,1.07],[1.13,1.33],[1.47,1.75],[1.82,2.14],[2.21,2.37],[2.42,2.57],[2.65,2.88],[2.95,3.16],[3.2,3.59],[3.66,3.99],[4.05,4.14],[4.19,4.26],[4.32,5.25]]},{"text":"When people look at stars, they like to find pictures and shapes.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.33,0.66],[0.72,0.93],[0.99,1.08],[1.16,1.92],[2.13,2.32],[2.4,2.61],[2.63,2.68],[2.75,2.98],[3.06,3.59],[3.65,3.79],[3.87,4.78]]},{"text":"Star pictures are called constellations. They are patterns we imagine in the sky.","words":[[0,0.4],[0.49,0.97],[1.03,1.17],[1.23,1.53],[1.6,2.81],[3.05,3.25],[3.3,3.42],[3.48,4.05],[4.11,4.25],[4.32,4.83],[4.89,4.98],[5.03,5.1],[5.16,6.08]]},{"text":"Some constellations look like animals or people. Others look like tools or shapes.","words":[[0,0.3],[0.36,1.29],[1.35,1.56],[1.61,1.83],[1.9,2.4],[2.47,2.58],[2.67,3.25],[3.63,4.02],[4.08,4.28],[4.35,4.55],[4.61,5.03],[5.08,5.2],[5.28,6.13]]},{"text":"Constellations help people remember where stars are in the sky.","words":[[0,1.04],[1.13,1.42],[1.49,1.86],[1.93,2.43],[2.51,2.76],[2.83,3.32],[3.39,3.62],[3.69,3.8],[3.85,3.92],[3.98,4.88]]},{"text":"Stars do not move around us each night. Earth’s spinning makes them appear to move.","words":[[0,0.53],[0.59,0.69],[0.77,0.92],[1,1.25],[1.3,1.65],[1.73,1.87],[1.95,2.19],[2.28,2.74],[3.03,3.48],[3.53,4.12],[4.26,4.54],[4.59,4.76],[4.83,5.22],[5.29,5.39],[5.47,6.18]]},{"text":"At bedtime, we remember: stars are far away, the Sun is a star, and patterns help us learn the sky.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.29,0.91],[0.93,1.04],[1.14,1.87],[2.11,2.59],[2.65,2.81],[2.88,3.15],[3.22,3.81],[4.02,4.17],[4.24,4.45],[4.52,4.62],[4.69,4.74],[4.81,5.43],[5.57,5.77],[5.86,6.4],[6.48,6.73],[6.82,6.95],[7.06,7.34],[7.4,7.49],[7.55,8.5]]}]}